{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a6e89c0f77f259ac","name":"GenoHaradan Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-a6e89c0f77f259ac","title":"GenoHaradan Talent Tree","revision":19669,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:23:27Z","sha256":"daf62ddfbd759e54d83f082fd6abb2f0e04d90b4ef8b5424f6ae3a1a3e3d1bf6","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19669","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=GenoHaradan%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a6e89c0f77f259ac","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Members of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The GenoHaradan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_GenoHaradan","referenceId":"reference:5f2da96a9a234322"}," are skilled not only in performing assassinations but also in manipulating others. An ancient organization dating back to the early days of the Republic, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The GenoHaradan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_GenoHaradan","referenceId":"reference:5f2da96a9a234322"}," are a clandestine group of assassins who pick their targets for political reason, though their true motives are rarely evident to those outside the organization.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Deadly Repercussions"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you reduce a target to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," or move the target to the bottom of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", all your opponents within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," of both you and your target take a -2 penalty on attack rolls until the beginning of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Manipulating Strike"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per turn when you successfully damage a target with a non-",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"},", make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intimidate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intimidate"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check against the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},". If successful, you can determine what the target does with its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," on its next turn. This is a Mind-Affecting effect.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved Manipulating Strike"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Manipulating Strike"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you successfully use the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Manipulating Strike"]}," Talent, you determine what the target does with its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"}," on its next turn. You cannot move an opponent into a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hazard"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hazard"}," (such as into lava or off a cliff).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Pulling the Strings"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check against the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," of a target within 12 squares. If you succeed, you move the target up to half its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," toward you through the safest route, and you make an immediate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," against the the target if it is within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". You cannot move an opponent into a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hazard"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hazard"}," (such as into lava or off a cliff).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
